06:09:39", "text": "彼は何をしたのか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22183.708, "timestamp": "06:09:43", "text": "喉にナイフを突きつけ、腰に当てた。ああ、だめだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22184.75, "timestamp": "06:09:44", "text": "おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22190.31, "timestamp": "06:09:50", "text": "いいえ、ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22194.83, "timestamp": "06:09:54", "text": "いや、いや、何？物語はなぜ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 22196.76, "timestamp": "06:09:56", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "he lunged forward and stabbed the guy who carried the child"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22197.75, "timestamp": "06:09:57", "text": "暗い、ああ、なぜ物語は暗くなっていくのか"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 22199.565, "timestamp": "06:09:59", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🌑🕶"}]